Regional Capacity Broker

Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs

Regional Capacity Broker is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime that
arbitrates facility-level capacity commitments across multiple data-center
sites. It owns regional capacity offers, asks, brokerage decisions,
brokerage-layer allocation commitments and their exact accounting. It does not
own each site's underlying capacity truth, cross-site placement topology,
reservation execution, local admission policy or workload scheduling. It is
built from the C++20 standard library only.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
